<title>USA: Corporate Express oks 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>Corporate Express oks 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>BROOMFIELD, Colo. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corporate Express Inc said Wednesday that its board has declared a three-for-two stock split in the form of a 50 percent dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>Distribution should be made by January 31 to shareholders of record January 24, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
